  "schema:comment": "The silicon-graphite blend SINTEF coated as SiGr-AQ-3, stated at 900 mAh/g theoretical specific capacity. The three silicon-graphite designs state three different capacities (510, 1150, 900 mAh/g), so they are three distinct physical blends and each gets its own lot; the blend ratios themselves are among the properties the source says the suppliers did not provide.",
